WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:06.240
SCP-999 Vs SCP-106. How would&nbsp;
the cuddliest of all SCPs fare&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:10.000
in a battle with the Foundation’s&nbsp;
most diabolical geriatric monster?

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.880
Our theory is that 999, with his unstoppable&nbsp;
good-vibe powers, could be the only one to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:20.640
reform this gloopy, wall-walking maniac. He&nbsp;
might help 106 overcome his desire to do evil,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:24.640
and begin to change him back into the&nbsp;
sweet old man he was always meant to be.

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:29.040
Instead of killing people, he’d take up fishing.&nbsp;
Instead of handfuls of human teeth, he’d have a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:34.160
pocket full of caramels. Instead of torturing you&nbsp;
forever, he’d just playfully pinch your cheek.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:38.800
Okay, maybe the turnaround wouldn’t be&nbsp;
that miraculous, but we can dream, right?

